2130
01:19:35,638 --> 01:19:36,840
Where Herc?

2131
01:19:36,873 --> 01:19:38,208
Who Herc?

2132
01:19:38,242 --> 01:19:39,877
Dah.

2133
01:19:39,910 --> 01:19:40,977
Dah.

2134
