Keep a way from me.

2174
01:21:21,343 --> 01:21:23,980
Oh (groaning).

2175
01:21:25,415 --> 01:21:27,250
- [Tom] Climbin' halfway
through hell in Greece

2176
01:21:27,283 --> 01:21:29,218
just to find some
stupid sheepskin.

2177
01:21:29,252 --> 01:21:32,088
Doh, gah, I hate these things,
oh.

2178
01:21:34,023 --> 01:21:34,857
- Hercules.

2179
01:21:35,958 --> 01:21:37,927
- [Joel] Well, he's just
invented the weed whipper.

2180
01:21:37,960 --> 01:21:40,130
- [Tom] Weed whipper, ooh.

2181
01:21:44,935 --> 01:21:45,768
Yee-who.

2182
01:21:52,042 --> 01:21:54,043
- [Crow] Oh, you're here.

2183
01:21:55,045 --> 01:21:56,680
- [Joel] Hey, thanks
for thowin' in gramps.

2184
01:21:56,713 --> 01:21:59,048
- Very good, that's the way.

2185
01:22:04,387 --> 01:22:07,157
- [Tom] That came
out of nowhere.

2186
01:22:16,132 --> 01:22:17,567
- [Crow] This is a weird
chain of events.

2187
01:22:17,600 --> 01:22:19,235
- [Tom] Doh.

2188
01:22:19,268 --> 01:22:23,473
- [Joel] Chains don't kill
people, Hercules kills people.

2189
01:22:25,842 --> 01:22:26,743
- [Tom] It's not
worth it fellas,

2190
01:22:26,777 --> 01:22:28,678
let's meet in the break room.

2191
01:22:28,712 --> 01:22:32,148
- [Crow] Boy, Herc can
really clear a room.

2192
01:22:32,182 --> 01:22:35,352
- [Joel] Taste it all,
Diet Hemlock.

2193
01:22:35,385 --> 01:22:37,353
- [Tom] I have a delicious
poison in the morning,

2194
01:22:37,387 --> 01:22:38,555
and that's it.

2195
01:22:40,257 --> 01:22:42,258
- [Joel] That's acrylic.

2196
01:22:42,292 --> 01:22:45,695
- [Crow] Now it's a
well-done Golden Fleece.

2197
01:22:45,728 --> 01:22:48,332
- [Tom] Ah, dad, let me
guess, something's wrong.

2198
01:22:48,365 --> 01:22:49,398
- Iole.

2199
01:22:49,432 --> 01:22:50,433
- [Crow] Lady-oh-o-ho.

2200
01:22:50,467 --> 01:22:52,968
