caught up with me.

2202
01:22:55,438 --> 01:22:58,408
- [Joel] That's what Michael
Milken probably said.

2203
01:22:58,442 --> 01:22:59,608
- So badly.

2204
01:22:59,642 --> 01:23:01,343
Jason should reign in Jalco.

2205
01:23:01,377 --> 01:23:04,547
- [Tom] Men are such babies
when they have a head cold.

2206
01:23:04,580 --> 01:23:05,748
