2207
01:23:05,782 --> 01:23:07,417
You mustn't lie any longer.

2208
01:23:07,450 --> 01:23:08,652
- My dear, it's useless.

2209
01:23:08,685 --> 01:23:10,853
The poison's working well.

2210
01:23:12,055 --> 01:23:13,790
